 75GE cL E$Data are from 1988BuZV, except as noted. The agreement among         
 75GE2cL different references is good, except for 1973Ka03 where the            
 75GE3cL energies are consistently too low. The average deviation from          
 75GE4cL 1714 to 2836 is -16 keV comparing the values with 1988BuZV.            
 75GE5cL In the region above 3000, the deviation is consistently 26 to          
 75GE6cL 36 keV low in 1973Ka03. If the 3000 level of 1973Ka03 is associated    
 75GE7cL with the 3028 level of 1972Ha74, the agreement between the levels      
 75GE8cL in 1988BuZV, 1972Ha74 and 1973Ka03 is excellent. The energies of the   
 75GE9cL peaks reported only by 1973Ka03, at 2050 and 2136 are increased by     
 75GEAcL 15 keV, the energy of the peak at 2924 is increased by 20 keV,         
 75GEBcL and the peaks above 3437 are increased by 30 keV when                  
